{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"start"},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev","str","^intro","/str",{"x()":"play_music","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","^I've recently become intersted in learning Japanese ever since I've grown closer to my friend ","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^. ","#","^id:3a","/#","\n","^We met at a young age when her family moved from Japan to my neighborhood in the US. ","#","^id:3b","/#","\n","^We didn't get along at first. ","#","^id:3c","/#","\n","^Her assertive attitude and excess confidence in herself rubbed me the wrong way. ","#","^id:3d","/#","\n","^But as time passed by, and we grew older, we got used to one another, and became friends. ","#","^id:3e","/#","\n","^Now we're both 20-year-old college students, and we've become best friends to each other! ","#","^id:3f","/#","\n","^I played a big role in her English learning journey, yet I never tried to learn Japanese seriously... ","#","^id:40","/#","\n","^Until now. ","#","^id:41","/#","\n","^Aoi: ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^! I found an exchange program that goes to Japan! We should do it together! ","#","^id:42","/#","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^ texted me late one night... ","#","^id:43","/#","\n","^I immediately agreed! ","#","^id:44","/#","\n","^And so, my journey to learn Japanese... it's finally starting. ","#","^id:45","/#","\n","^For real this time! ","#","^id:46","/#","\n",{"->":"start2"},null],"start2":["ev","str","^hallway","/str",{"x()":"background","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^ and I walk together through the hallways, getting used to our surroundings. ","#","^id:47","/#","\n","^Even though we've been here for a few weeks already, it still feels so different from back home. ","#","^id:48","/#","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str",true,{"x()":"show_or_hide","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^Aoi (Happy): ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^, look a Japanese fas